developers, students, and hobbyists can read it, learn from it, run it for
their own projects, modify it, and build their own things with it.

**Commercial use is strictly forbidden.** You may NOT use RodexDB — in whole
or in part, directly or indirectly — to make money, to run a business, to
sell, to license, to sublicense, or to provide paid services or hosted
offerings (SaaS) to third parties.

